From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lech Piekarski <isilweo@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:43:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: bluetooth: qcom,qca2066-bt: Document
 QCA9379

The Bluetooth part of the QCA9379 WLAN/BT combo chip is set up by
hci_qca like the QCA6174 (ROME), over UART with an enable GPIO and the
32 kHz sleep clock, and loads its rampatch and NVM by the controller
version it reports. Document it with qcom,qca6174-bt as the fallback.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Source: https://github.com/isilweo/linux/commit/1d498dceaffffb189420680ab378b13effee8f51
Base-commit: 1c1a919fd728c881e7ccaf3cf18a3cf3055e0429
---
 .../bindings/net/bluetooth/qcom,qca2066-bt.yaml        | 10 +++++++---
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/qcom,qca2066-bt.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/qcom,qca2066-bt.yaml
index d4f167c9b7e1..79a2ae5ce294 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/qcom,qca2066-bt.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/qcom,qca2066-bt.yaml
@@ -12,9 +12,13 @@ maintainers:
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    enum:
-      - qcom,qca2066-bt
-      - qcom,qca6174-bt
+    oneOf:
+      - enum:
+          - qcom,qca2066-bt
+          - qcom,qca6174-bt
+      - items:
+          - const: qcom,qca9379-bt
+          - const: qcom,qca6174-bt
 
   clocks:
     items:
